# Status

The single source of truth for open tasks — the Today tab renders exactly what's below, nothing
is derived from anywhere else. Copy this file to `context/STATUS.md` (the setup skill also creates
an empty one for you).

## Tasks (open)

### Upwork

- [ ] **Fill in context/expertise.md** #admin
  Nothing else runs well until this exists — search tracks and scoring both read it.
- [ ] **Run the screener for the first time** #deep-work
  Say "check upwork" once expertise.md is filled in.

## Frisch erledigt

<!-- Recently finished tasks land here, newest on top, capped at ~6. Not required for the
     dashboard to work — the Today tab only reads "Tasks (open)" above. -->

---

**Task line format:** `- [ ] **Headline** (due DD.MM.) #category` — category is one of
`deep-work` / `quick-win` / `comms` / `prep` / `admin`, and controls the urgent/important quadrant
badge (`admin`/`prep`/`deep-work` count as important; a due date within 7 days counts as urgent).
An optional indented line right below becomes the task's context note. A `### Heading` groups
tasks under a project name.
